{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 7919,
    "dDurationMs": 4531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the amazing and beautiful Millennium\nrun - it's a simulation of the large-scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12450,
    "dDurationMs": 3919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evolution of the universe from just after\nthe big bang all the way to the present."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16369,
    "dDurationMs": 4221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The researchers at the Max Plank Institute\nin Germany who ran the simulation began with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20590,
    "dDurationMs": 2769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the latest observations of what the early\nuniverse looked like - [the cosmic microwave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23359,
    "dDurationMs": 2581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "background radiation] and simulated the evolution\nof the universe forward in time using the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25940,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "laws of physics to see how the galaxies and\ngalactic clusters of today grew out of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26940,
    "dDurationMs": 5659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tiny fluctuations in the density of the early\nuniverse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32599,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a testament to their success, the Millennium\nsimulation looks strikingly similar to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36800,
    "dDurationMs": 5009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actual universe as shown in the equally impressive\n3D map of the universe created by the Sloan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41809,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Digital Sky Survey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44579,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the millennium run was no small feat - it\ncontained over 10 billion simulated particles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48789,
    "dDurationMs": 5750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ran on over 500 computers for a total\nof 350,000 hours, or 40 years, of processor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54539,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55539,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So not to be outdone, here's my version that\nI did on my laptop in only a few minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59339,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I did the simulation using off-the-shelf\nvideo special effects software (in fact, if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63409,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you want to try this yourself, I believe you\ncan even download a free, fully-functional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66190,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "demo)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67190,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how did I simulate the universe on my laptop?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69840,
    "dDurationMs": 4489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simple - I began with a real image of the\nuniverse about 13.7 billion years ago, used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74329,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it to tell a particle simulator which particles\nshould be lighter and which should be heavier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77770,
    "dDurationMs": 4449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(to simulate the slight variations of density\nin the early universe), turned on a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82219,
    "dDurationMs": 4031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bit of gravity, a little bit of friction,\nand watched the particles go!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86250,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, it's by no means the millennium simulation\n- for starters, it's only two-dimensional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92170,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the gravity isn't physically accurate…\nbut nevertheless, here you have it: the large-scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96550,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evolution of the universe as simulated on\na laptop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101189,
    "dDurationMs": 5911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those of you interested in the particular\ndetails of how to make this particle simulation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107100,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in After Effects, check out the tutorial HERE."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109520,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you just want more minutephysics, click\nhere to check out last week's video about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112189,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what would happen if we dug a tunnel through\nthe earth and jumped in."
    } ]
  } ]
}
